{"id":"16945c5554cf582d","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-scp-characterization.md","title":"thm-scp-characterization","display":"thm-scp-characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-scp]]","[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-language]]","[[93-df-logic]]","[[93-df-valuation]]"],"display":"thm-scp-characterization","label":"93-thm-scp-characterization","aliases":["93-thm-scp-characterization"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dce23e9e6907b821\" href=\"?note=dce23e9e6907b821\" title=\"93-df-scp\">93-df-scp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a33dcee0f62c9026\" href=\"?note=a33dcee0f62c9026\" title=\"93-df-language\">93-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8181bcdfbad8d73a\" href=\"?note=8181bcdfbad8d73a\" title=\"93-df-valuation\">93-df-valuation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-scp-characterization"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-scp-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-scp-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-scp-characterization-thm-scp-characterization\">thm-scp-characterization <code>thm-scp-characterization</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L=\\langle\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma},F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathsf L=\\langle\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma},F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\rangle\\)</span> is a logic presentation and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma}}\">\\(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma}}\\)</span> is its type-indexed formula algebra.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}\\)</span> have the signatures fixed in their source definitions.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_{93}(T;F,\\vdash)\">\\(\\Lambda_{93}(T;F,\\vdash)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SCP}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SCP}_{93}\\)</span> are exactly those of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dce23e9e6907b821\" href=\"?note=dce23e9e6907b821\" title=\"93-df-scp\">93-df-scp</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}scp\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathsf L=\\langle\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma},F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\rangle\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SCP}_{93}(\\mathsf L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})\n\\land F=T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma}},\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T;\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}})\n\\to\\Lambda_{93}(T;F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L})\n\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma}})\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}scp\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathsf L=\\langle\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma},F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\rangle\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SCP}_{93}(\\mathsf L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})\n\\land F=T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma}},\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T;\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}})\n\\to\\Lambda_{93}(T;F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L})\n\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma}})\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is precisely compatibility of each local Frege equivalence with every connective, hence congruencehood.  The property belongs to a logic and is not an equation between a generated variety and a predicate value.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-scp-characterization-thm-scp-characterization","text":"thm-scp-characterization `thm-scp-characterization`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-scp","status":"resolved","id":"dce23e9e6907b821","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-scp]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"a33dcee0f62c9026","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-valuation","status":"resolved","id":"8181bcdfbad8d73a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-valuation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-scp","status":"resolved","id":"dce23e9e6907b821","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Lambda_{93}(T;F,\\vdash)$, $\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash}$, and $\\mathrm{SCP}_{93}$ are exactly those of [[93-df-scp]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf L=\\langle\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma},F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda_{93}(T;F,\\vdash)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SCP}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}scp\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathsf L=\\langle\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma},F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\rangle\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SCP}_{93}(\\mathsf L)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})\n\\land F=T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L})\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma}},\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T;\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}})\n\\to\\Lambda_{93}(T;F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L})\n\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma}})\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1715,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["dce23e9